            <p>
                Note that <code>TerrianGenerator</code>
                throws <code>NotImplementedException</code>,
                <code>ChunkGenerationPipeline.Generate</code> throws,
                and noise/biome classes are not wired into the current
                path. Do not document procedural terrain features as
                shipped behavior yet.
            </p>
